traditional architecture while gaining a sense of the district’s historical identity and…"],["Dongnae Traditional Archery Experience","activity",35.2076,129.0831,"Chungnyeol-daero, Dongnae-gu","09:00–18:00","","","","r","A cultural experience allowing visitors to observe or participate in traditional Korean archery, offering insight into historic martial practices associated with Confucian values."],["Bokcheon Museum Guided Tour Program","activity",35.2051,129.0864,"Bokcheon-ro, Dongnae-gu","By schedule","","","","r","A guided tour program explaining archaeological findings from the Bokcheon-dong tombs, allowing visitors to gain deeper understanding of ancient burial customs and artifacts."],["Dongnae Traditional Music Practice Hall","activity",35.2054,129.0816,"Myeongnyun-dong, Dongnae-gu","Varies by program","","","","r","A practice space for traditional Korean music groups. Visitors may observe rehearsals or attend small public sessions, offering exposure to regional performing arts."],["Dongnae Mountain Trail","activity",35.2119,129.0821,"Myeongnyun-dong, Dongnae-gu","Open 24 hours","","","","r","A neighborhood mountain trail offering moderate hiking conditions and views over Dongnae district. Popular with locals for short but rewarding hikes."],["Dongnae Halmae Pajeon","restaurant",35.2057,129.0861,"Bokcheon-ro, Dongnae-gu","10:30–22:00","","","","r","A famous restaurant serving Dongnae-style green onion pancakes, a regional specialty often introduced to tourists as a traditional local dish."]]}